Rosetta was originally planned to launch in January 2003 (toward comet 46P/Wirtanen), but that launch was postponed due to the Ariane 5 failure in late 2002 and other delays. The actual launch of Rosetta from Kourou occurred on **2 March 2004**, after which it went on to orbit comet 67P/Churyumov–Gerasimenko.

So 2003 is incorrect — it reflects the originally planned launch year, not the actual launch year.

