The theatrical 1980 release of Superman II was credited to **Richard Lester**, not Richard Donner. Donner directed most of the original footage but was fired partway through production; Lester was brought in to finish the film, and per a court/credit arrangement (partly stemming from his producing credit on the first film's shooting schedule), Lester received the official directorial credit on the theatrical version. Donner was not credited as director of the 1980 release — his footage was later used in the 2006 "Richard Donner Cut."

So the proposed answer is incorrect.

